{
  "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. Fernand's three public hosts declare one flat palette on :root (raw/css-vars.json) and each resolves it slightly differently — core.* carries the marketing resolution as the canonical palette, and every host re-emits its vocabulary at the same paths in its surface set: light (marketing), help (docs light), app (the SPA's grey family and --viewport-vars) and dark (the docs body.dark-mode remap) — so each theme resolves its own values. Measured roles alias to the declared values they match.",
